+# Remove the [sync] area keys
+
+The slice deletes the [sync] area keys, their parsing (internal/config/sync.go
+SyncTable area handling), the per-area opt-in branches in push/pull, and the
+doc and help text that name them, and heals existing repos through satelle
+init with a CHANGELOG ### Breaking entry.
+
+## Acceptance criteria
+
+1. satelle.toml accepts no per-area [sync] key (all, workflows, principles,
+   skills, constitution, agents, tasks, settings, documents, stories, ledger,
+   executions); loading one fails naming the key, proven by a config test.
+2. SyncTable carries no area fields and push/pull have no per-area branch,
+   proven by the sync tests passing with the branches deleted.
+3. The help of satelle sync names no removed key, proven by a CLI test.
+4. go build ./... and go test ./... pass.
